{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月23日 09:14 星期一</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月23日 09:22 星期一</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>港鐵今早9時02分指，何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段時要慢駛，觀塘線整體行車時間料需額外10至15分鐘。約10分鐘後，港鐵指事故已經處理，觀塘線列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:43:27.196669+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:14:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:24.199277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:37:24.968622+00:00","content_hash":"0752655c68911604ca18d609cd1cfe29ddc8bdeb233f8779e98657939dc0c611","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}